#N canvas 0 50 760 560 12;
#X text 20 10 adi-param-proof -- [adi.param] end to end (ADR-0177 d5 \, ADR-0188 d3). The abstraction's own outlet feeds the array \, so what is read back is what the abstraction produced: its DEFAULT at load \, and the host's value after.;
#X obj 20 420 adc~ 1 2;
#X obj 20 470 dac~ 1 2;
#X obj 20 130 adi.param \$0 1 0 1 0.5 - lin Probe;
#X text 20 170 Its [loadbang] sends the default \, 0.5 \, with nothing running but Pd. That is the promise ADR-0177 d5 makes about vanilla Pd \, and it is asserted rather than assumed.;
#X obj 20 260 list prepend 0;
#X obj 20 300 list trim;
#X obj 20 340 s \$0-adiarr-1;
#X obj 420 260 adi.array \$0 1 4 200 -1 1 - Probe;
#X text 420 300 Cell 0 is whatever the parameter last carried.;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 1 1 2 1;
#X connect 3 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
